---
description: Reuse existing UI before creating new components
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: true
---

Before introducing a new UI component, search the codebase for an existing implementation.

Prefer, in order:
1. Reuse an existing component.
2. Extend an existing component.
3. Compose existing components.
4. Create a new component only when none of the above fit.

Avoid creating components that duplicate existing behavior or styling with small differences.